<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">o. The Subscriber, its affiliates, their agents, and any other persons
acting on their behalf is not (i) a person or entity named on the OFAC List, or a person or entity prohibited by any OFAC sanctions program,
