<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">k. This Subscription Agreement may be executed in one or more counterparts
(including by electronic signature or email of a .pdf) and by different parties in separate counterparts, with the same effect as if
